Each file here is the unmodified DevIcon "<name>-original" glyph placed on a
plain white rounded tile with a 1px neutral border. The tile is added by this
repository so every mark stays legible on both the light and dark GitHub
themes without swapping assets; the glyph artwork itself is unchanged.

Glyphs vendored (from icons/<name>/<name>-original.svg in the DevIcon repo):
  nextjs, typescript, python, fastapi, supabase, githubactions, vercel, react

No DevIcon mark exists for "Render"; that stack item is shown as plain text
in the project card instead.
